#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/clock-domain.md:10
msgid "Clock-domain ownership and coordination"
msgstr "时钟域所有权与协调"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/clock-domain.md:12
msgid ""
"A clock-domain owner coordinates admitted consumers and explicit "
"transitions. Clock identity, epochs, retained consumers and actual hardware "
"outcomes remain part of the selected contract."
msgstr "时钟域所有者协调已获准消费者和显式转换。时钟身份、纪元、保留消费者及实际硬件结果始终属于选定合同。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/clock-domain.md:16
msgid ""
"Trusted static composition includes `clock_domain_owner.h`. Ordinary callers"
" keep the opaque interface; cold helpers and span validation remain private."
" Storage fields are implementation state after construction, not application"
" controls."
msgstr ""
"受信静态装配包含 "
"`clock_domain_owner.h`。普通调用者使用不透明接口；冷态辅助及范围校验保持私有。构造后的存储字段属于实现状态，不是应用控制入口。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/clock-domain.md:21
msgid "Public declarations"
msgstr "公共声明"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/clock-domain.md:23
msgid "clock_domain.h"
msgstr "clock_domain.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/clock-domain.md:25
msgid "Explicit clock consumers and epoch-bound drain control."
msgstr "显式时钟消费者与绑定 epoch 的排空控制。"

